# HS-20260819-13: canonicalize to www.hojaseeds.pk.
# Notification.permission and PushSubscription are per-origin -- with
# both hojaseeds.pk and www.hojaseeds.pk previously serving 200 directly
# (no redirect), a customer already granted on one saw "default" again on
# the other, causing the soft opt-in card to reappear confusingly. A
# single canonical origin fixes this at the root, no JS change needed for
# this part.
https://hojaseeds.pk/*  https://www.hojaseeds.pk/:splat  301!
